# Session 3 Walkthrough — FastAPI + Streamlit Dashboard

## What Was Built

A production-ready API and interactive dashboard for the Dynamic Pricing Engine.

## API Endpoints (Verified ✅)

| Endpoint | Method | Status | Response |
|----------|--------|--------|----------|
| `/health` | GET | ✅ 200 | `{"status":"ok","model":"xgboost_best_model"}` |
| `/categories` | GET | ✅ 200 | `["Electronics","Fashion","Home","Beauty","Sports","Other"]` |
| `/predict` | POST | ✅ 200 | `{"recommended_price_usd": 27.67, "demand_tier": "High", ...}` |
| `/batch_predict` | POST | ✅ Impl | Max 100 items per batch |
| `/docs` | GET | ✅ Auto | Swagger UI (auto-generated) |

## Streamlit Dashboard (3 Pages)

1. **Single Item Pricer** — Form inputs + gauge chart showing price vs competitors
2. **Batch Analyzer** — CSV upload, color-coded results (green=below/red=above/yellow=at market)
3. **Market Intelligence** — EDA/SHAP chart viewer + key metrics cards with category filter

